---
// Experiment 2-1: user request → local LLM service → model inference → local tool execution, with tool results returned to the model (redraw of Fig 2-5).
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 420"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d2-ltc-title d2-ltc-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d2-ltc-title">Local LLM tool calling architecture</title>
	<desc id="d2-ltc-desc">
		Four stages in order. The user request, for example "Help me contact Xfinity to negotiate", goes to the local LLM
		service, vLLM or Ollama, which is OpenAI compatible. Model inference decides and generates a tool_call. Local tool
		execution calls a function or an external API. A dashed arrow returns the tool results to the model, which then
		generates the final response.
	</desc>
	<defs>
		<marker id="d2-ltc-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
			<path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-arrowhead"></path>
		</marker>
	</defs>

	<text x="2" y="28" class="dg-title">Local LLM tool calling architecture</text>

	<g class="dg-node dg-env">
		<rect x="6" y="48" width="394" height="64" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="203" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">User request</text>
		<text x="203" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">"Help me contact Xfinity to negotiate"</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="6" y="144" width="394" height="64" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="203" y="170" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700">Local LLM service</text>
		<text x="203" y="194" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">vLLM/Ollama (OpenAI compatible)</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-model">
		<rect x="6" y="240" width="394" height="64" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="203" y="266" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Model inference</text>
		<text x="203" y="290" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Decide and generate tool_call</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-tools">
		<rect x="6" y="336" width="394" height="64" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="203" y="362" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Local tool execution</text>
		<text x="203" y="386" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Call function / external API</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="203" y1="112" x2="203" y2="142" marker-end="url(#d2-ltc-arrow)"></line>
		<line x1="203" y1="208" x2="203" y2="238" marker-end="url(#d2-ltc-arrow)"></line>
		<line x1="203" y1="304" x2="203" y2="334" marker-end="url(#d2-ltc-arrow)"></line>
		<path d="M400,368 H436 V272 H402" stroke-dasharray="8 4" marker-end="url(#d2-ltc-arrow)"></path>
	</g>
	<text x="448" y="296" class="dg-edge-label">Return tool results</text>
	<text x="448" y="318" class="dg-edge-label">to the model, then</text>
	<text x="448" y="340" class="dg-edge-label">generate the final</text>
	<text x="448" y="362" class="dg-edge-label">response</text>
</svg>
